  },
  {
   "start": 45.54,
   "end": 48.55,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.993,
   "text": "There's a bit of shit weather coming in from over there.",
   "i": 3
  },
  {
   "start": 49.33,
   "end": 50.49,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.994,
   "text": "Give me one more try.",
   "i": 4
  },
  {
   "start": 51.15,
   "end": 52.77,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.946,
   "text": "We can both hit the top and make 10.",
   "i": 5
  },
  {
   "start": 56.67,
   "end": 58.21,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.988,
   "text": "Oh, I want to summit today, Tommy.",
   "i": 6
  },
  {
   "start": 58.27,
   "end": 60.21,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.999,
   "text": "And that's exactly why you have a climbing partner.",
   "i": 7
  },
  {
   "start": 60.65,
   "end": 63.17,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.992,
   "text": "So that someone can make the call when one of you loses the plot.",
   "i": 8
  },
  {
   "start": 70.05,
   "end": 73.73,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 1.0,
   "text": "It was beautiful climbing up until when it wasn't.",
   "i": 9
  },
  {
   "start": 73.73,
   "end": 84.06,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.951,
   "text": "Just wondering whether we should take a right check tomorrow.",
   "i": 10
  },
  {
   "start": 84.06,
   "end": 86.85,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.914,
   "text": "That's all. Are you kidding me? It's just a little weather.",
   "i": 11
  },
  {
   "start": 90.02,
   "end": 95.02,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.983,
   "text": "You know, just... I just feel like sometimes you rush it a little bit, that's all.",
   "i": 12
  },
  {
   "start": 120.0,
   "end": 121.16,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.999,
   "text": "You do this every time.",
   "i": 13
  },
  {
   "start": 121.3,
   "end": 125.14,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.999,
   "text": "You know, the climb gets tough, and then all of a sudden you start talking like this.",
   "i": 14
  },
  {
   "start": 125.2,
   "end": 129.64,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.996,
   "text": "I'm just talking about slowing it down a little bit, not doing so many extreme things.",
   "i": 15
  },
  {
   "start": 135.55,
   "end": 139.17,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.995,
   "text": "As an old saying, luck is like anything else you take up the mountain.",
   "i": 16
  },
  {
   "start": 139.35,
   "end": 140.73,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 1.0,
   "text": "Eventually, it's going to run out.",
   "i": 17
  },
  {
   "start": 143.83,
   "end": 147.73,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 1.0,
   "text": "You're going to tell me your luck has run out halfway up a mountain.",
   "i": 18
  },
  {
   "start": 147.73,
   "end": 149.35,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.943,
   "text": "I think my lucky compass is saying.",
   "i": 19
  },
  {
   "start": 182.51,
   "end": 183.79,
   "lang": "en",
   "src": "auto",
   "p": 0.977,
   "text": "We'll get down first thing, okay?",
